sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Gateway as Browser gateway
    participant Rules as Deterministic safety rules
    participant Tool as transfer_to_human
    participant Queue as Phase 2 backend queue
    participant Staff as Authenticated staff UI
    Caller->>Gateway: Request a person or safety-triggering utterance
    Gateway->>Rules: Check before the LLM
    Rules->>Tool: Reason category and urgency
    alt Phase 1
        Tool-->>Gateway: transferred=false, metadata recorded only
        Gateway-->>Caller: Live transfer unavailable, configured non-clinical guidance
    else Phase 2 after approved queue and staff-auth contracts
        Tool->>Queue: Create escalation with service plus conversation auth
        Queue-->>Gateway: Queued - not connected
        Staff->>Queue: Authenticated read and accept
        Queue-->>Gateway: Accepted
        Note over Gateway,Staff: Connected requires implemented staff communication transport
    end
